<div class="policy-page">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: July 2026</p>

  <p>OpenCRO respects your privacy.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect as little information as possible.</p>
  <p>When you visit this website, our hosting provider may automatically record standard technical information such as:</p>
  <ul class="policy-list">
    <li>IP address</li>
    <li>Browser type</li>
    <li>Device type</li>
    <li>Pages visited</li>
    <li>Date and time of your visit</li>
    <li>Basic performance and security logs</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These logs help us keep the website secure, monitor performance, and improve the site.</p>
  <p>We do not use tracking pixels. We do not use advertising trackers. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2>If you contact us</h2>
  <p>If you book a meeting, subscribe to our newsletter, or contact us by email, we may receive information that you choose to provide, such as:</p>
  <ul class="policy-list">
    <li>Name</li>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Company</li>
    <li>Phone number (if you provide it)</li>
    <li>LinkedIn profile (if you share it)</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We use this information only to communicate with you.</p>
  <p>We never sell or share your contact information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>OpenCRO does not use advertising or tracking cookies.</p>
  <p>Our hosting provider may use essential cookies required for the website to function properly.</p>

  <h2>Public analyses</h2>
  <p>OpenCRO publishes risk analyses generated from publicly available information, including regulatory submissions, public company websites, product documentation, scientific publications, and public announcements.</p>
  <p>These analyses do not use confidential customer information nor personal data.</p>

  <h2>Data security</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable steps to protect the information you voluntarily provide.</p>
  <p>No method of storing or transmitting data over the Internet is completely secure, but we aim to keep the amount of personal information we hold to an absolute minimum.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You may contact us at any time to:</p>
  <ul class="policy-list">
    <li>request that we delete information you have voluntarily provided</li>
    <li>ask questions about this policy</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The latest version will always appear on this page.</p>
  <p>You can contact OpenCRO using the contact information at <a href="/contact">opencro.com/contact</a>.</p>
</div>
